        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 935RT, Modern 935 Knob with Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Knob with Rectangular Rose is a great combination of shapes. The knob is round and the rose is rectangular, but they work well together to form a contemporary knobset perfect for modern homes. The  <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a> collections 935 knob with rectangular rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick with available backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 8 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 935RT Modern Knob with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 935RT Modern Knob with Rectangular Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Knob with Rectangular Rose, Omnia 935RT",
                "description": "Omnia 935RT, Modern Knob with Rectangular Rose - The Modern Knob with Rectangular Rose is a great combination of shapes. The knob is round and the rose is rectangular, but they work well together to form a contemporary knobset perfect for modern homes. The 935 knob with rectangular rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 1-3/4 inches thick with available backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from 8 finishes.",
                "keywords": "Modern Knob with Rectangular Roses, Omnia 935RT, OMN-935RT, Omnia 935 Knob with Rectangular Roses,  omnia prodigy collections, solid brass door knobs, Omnia Standard door knobs, modern knobs, passage knobs, privacy knobs, Omnia 935RT Modern Knob with Modern Rectangular Rosettes, Contemporary Knobsets,  Modern 935 Knob with Rectangular Roses,"
